{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Time series for one standardized financial concept for one company (e.g. 'revenue', 'net_income', 'eps_diluted', 'total_assets'), from SEC EDGAR XBRL filings with history back to 2015. Use for a single metric's trend; use get_financials instead for full statements per period, and list_financial_concepts for the valid concept slugs. Read-only; no API key. Each point carries the period start/end, fiscal year and period labels, the value and unit, and per-value provenance (form, filed date, accession number); duplicates and restatements are resolved latest-filed-wins, and values computed from reported components carry derived:true plus a 'derived:' tag \u2014 including Q4 points derived as fiscal year minus Q1\u2013Q3. The series spans a company's predecessor chain when a ticker moved between filers, and the response carries a staleness flag when SEC submissions show a newer filing than the stored facts. `period` defaults to all (annual plus quarterly points); `limit` defaults to 40 points, max 200.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"cik":{"description":"SEC CIK number (takes precedence over ticker)","type":"number"},"concept":{"description":"Canonical concept slug (see list_financial_concepts)","enum":["revenue","cost_of_revenue","gross_profit","research_and_development","selling_general_admin","operating_income","net_income","eps_basic","eps_diluted","operating_cash_flow","capital_expenditures","net_interest_income","noninterest_income","insurance_premiums","dividends_paid","total_assets","total_liabilities","stockholders_equity","cash_and_equivalents","long_term_debt","short_term_debt","shares_outstanding"],"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":40,"description":"Max data points (default 40, max 200)","type":"number"},"period":{"default":"all","description":"Annual points, quarterly points, or all. Default: all","enum":["annual","quarterly","all"],"type":